  "question": "求极限 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sum_{k = 1}^{n}(n + 1 - k)[nC_n^k ]^{-1}$",
  "answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sum_{k = 1}^{n}(n + 1 - k)[nC_n^k ]^{-1} = 0.$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 这是无穷和形式的极限，将通项写成分式后做适当的放大与缩小，再用夹逼原理."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "$C_n^k = \\frac{n(n - 1)\\cdots(n - k + 1)}{k!}$ . 当 $k < n$ 时，有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "(n + 1 - k) \\left(n C _ {n} ^ {k}\\right) ^ {- 1} = n ^ {- 2} \\frac {k !}{(n - 1) \\cdots (n - k + 2)} \\leqslant 2 n ^ {- 2},"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "因此"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "0 <   \\sum_ {k = 1} ^ {n} (n + 1 - k) \\left(n C _ {n} ^ {k}\\right) ^ {- 1} \\leqslant 2 \\sum_ {k = 1} ^ {n - 1} n ^ {- 2} + \\frac {1}{n} <   \\frac {2}{n} + \\frac {1}{n} = \\frac {3}{n} \\rightarrow 0 (n \\rightarrow \\infty)."
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "所以 $\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sum_{k = 1}^{n}(n + 1 - k)[nC_n^k ]^{-1} = 0.$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$\\lim_{n\\to \\infty}\\sum_{k = 1}^{n}(n + 1 - k)[nC_n^k ]^{-1} = 0.$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "极限计算"
    ]
  },
